	(text "MAX98357A I2S class-D from VSYS (Gate C). SD_MODE driven directly from GPIO9 (AMP_SD): high = left channel, low = 0.6 uA shutdown; 100k pull-down"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 77.47 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7c50ac68-8399-5d5f-98e6-14e9c7ca4699")
	)
	(text "plus the internal 100k: silent from reset (ODD JOBS 116). A0's 2.2k series resistor is gone: its datasheet reason (logic high above VDD) cannot"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 80.01 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7b459d25-695a-5f7e-b223-37dd02cec6c9")
	)
	(text "occur, +3V3 <= VSYS by topology. I2S on GPIO40/41/42. GAIN_SLOT open = 9 dB. Speaker: Same Sky CMS-150803-088S-X8 (15 x 8 x 3 mm, 8 ohm, 0.8 W) in"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 82.55 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "abd31691-bae0-5492-8682-f4dfe8c1b3ca")
	)
	(text "the base at 9 o'clock; its own spring contacts press on two pads on B.Cu (LS501)."
